<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Campus Events - All Events</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
            color: #333;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            align-items: center;
        }

        nav ul li {
            margin-left: 25px;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            color: #e2e8f0;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover, nav ul li a.active {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }

        .nav-register-btn {
            background-color: #38bdf8;
            color: #0f172a !important;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-register-btn:hover {
            background-color: #0ea5e9;
        }

        /* Search & Title Section */
        .header-section {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px 20px 20px;
        }

        .header-section h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            color: #1e293b;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .search-box {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .search-box input {
            padding: 10px 15px;
            width: 280px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .events-container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px 20px 60px 20px;
        }

        .category-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #1e293b;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #38bdf8;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .event-grid {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .event-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            width: 300px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .event-card h3 {
            color: #1e293b;
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .event-card p {
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #e0f2fe;
            color: #0369a1;
            font-size: 12px;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #10b981;
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .card-btn:hover {
            background-color: #059669;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #1e293b;
            color: #94a3b8;
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">🎉 CampusEvents</div>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="events.html" class="active">All Events</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Technical</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Cultural</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Sports</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>
            <li><a href="register.html" class="nav-register-btn">Register</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="header-section">
        <h1>Explore All Campus Events</h1>
        <p>Find technical, cultural, and sports events happening around campus.</p>
        <div class="search-box">
            <input type="text" placeholder="Search events by name...">
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="events-container">
        
        <h2 class="category-title">Technical Events</h2>
        <div class="event-grid">
            <div class="event-card">
                <span class="tag">Coding</span>
                <h3>Tech Hackathon 2026</h3>
                <p><strong>Date:</strong> 15th March 2026</p>
                <p><strong>Venue:</strong> Auditorium 1</p>
                <p>24-hour coding challenge to build real-world software solutions.</p>
                <a href="register.html" class="card-btn">Register Now</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="event-card">
                <span class="tag">Robotics</span>
                <h3>Robo Race Challenge</h3>
                <p><strong>Date:</strong> 18th March 2026</p>
                <p><strong>Venue:</strong> Science Block Ground</p>
                <p>Design your bots and navigate through complex obstacle tracks.</p>
                <a href="register.html" class="card-btn">Register Now</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="category-title">Cultural Events</h2>
        <div class="event-grid">
            <div class="event-card">
                <span class="tag">Music & Dance</span>
                <h3>Annual Cultural Fest</h3>
                <p><strong>Date:</strong> 22nd March 2026</p>
                <p><strong>Venue:</strong> Main Open Amphitheatre</p>
                <p>Showcase your talent in singing, group dancing, and drama performances.</p>
                <a href="register.html" class="card-btn">Register Now</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="category-title">Sports Events</h2>
        <div class="event-grid">
            <div class="event-card">
                <span class="tag">Outdoor Sports</span>
                <h3>Inter-College Cricket Cup</h3>
                <p><strong>Date:</strong> 5th April 2026</p>
                <p><strong>Venue:</strong> Sports Complex</p>
                <p>Knockout cricket tournament for department and college teams.</p>
                <a href="register.html" class="card-btn">Register Now</a>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Campus Event Portal | All Events Page</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
